{
  "job_B9.6.6_20251003_115103": {
    "chunk_text": "omlic untrymnes, \u00fe\u00e6t he biscop beon ne meahte. Eft se papa nedde \u00feone abbud Adrianus, \u00fe\u00e6t he biscophade onfenge. \u00dea b\u00e6d he hine eldenne & fyrstes, hw\u00e6\u00f0er he \u00e6fter f\u00e6ce meahte o\u00f0erne findan, \u00fee mon to W\u00e6s in \u00fea tid sum munuc in Rome, se w\u00e6s cu\u00f0 Adriane \u00fe\u00e6m abbude, \u00fe\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Se w\u00e6s acenned in Tarso Cilicio: w\u00e6s se mon ge in weoruldgewreotum, ge in godcundum, ge in \u00deeosne mon Adrianus se abbud \u00fe\u00e6m papan cy\u00f0de, & s\u00e6gde \u00fe\u00e6t he to biscope gehalgad beon Ond hw\u00e6\u00f0re \u00feis ar\u00e6ddon betweonum him, \u00fe\u00e6t he se abbud his latteow beon sceolde in Breotone, Ond \u00feonne gen eac \u00fe\u00e6tte he scolde his fultemend beon in godcundre lare, ond \u00fe\u00e6t he geornlice \u00dea w\u00e6s he \u00e6rest to subdiacone gehalgad; & \u00fea baad feower mona\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6t him feax geweoxe, \u00dea w\u00e6s he gehalgad from Uitalio \u00fe\u00e6m papan to biscope ymb syx hund wintra & eahta & syxtig & swa \u00e6tg\u00e6dre mid Adriano \u00feam abbude in Sexta Kalendas Junias w\u00e6s to Breotone onsended. \u00dea ferdon heo \u00e6tg\u00e6dre \u00e6rest to Masilia & \u00feonon \u00feurh Arela lond, \u00fe\u00e6t heo cwomon to Iohanne & he swa dyde; h\u00e6fde heo mid micelre are mid him, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t Ebrinus se ealdormon him spede & \u00d0a ferde Theodorus se biscop to \u00e6gelberhte biscope Parissior",
